  _headline: "Lixo org\xE2nico vira g\xE1s de cozinha no bairro"
  _headlineEn: Food waste becomes cooking gas in the neighborhood
  _body: "Restos de comida e esterco viram biog\xE1s e adubo. Dona Cida assou o primeiro
    p\xE3o no g\xE1s do bairro e jura que ficou mais macio."
  _bodyEn: Food scraps and manure turn into biogas and fertilizer. Mrs. Cida baked
    the first loaf on neighborhood gas and swears it is softer.
